# 301 clowa.de -> github.com/clowa.
#
# Unlike the domain->domain redirects, the target is a fixed GitHub org URL, so
# {uri} is intentionally dropped: every request on this host lands on the org
# page rather than an appended (and non-existent) sub-path.
#
# NOTE: for this to reach Caddy in production, `clowa.de` must also be attached
# as a custom_domain in serverless.yml (and its DNS pointed at Scaleway).
clowa.de:80 {
	import otel
	redir https://github.com/clowa permanent
}
